  "id": "booking-confirmation",
  "meta": {
    "description": "Triggered by the FastAPI backend after book_appointment/reschedule_appointment succeed (detailed spec §9). Verifies the HMAC signature and timestamp, validates the payload, checks for a prior idempotent send, emails the confirmation, retries once with backoff on Gmail failure, and falls back to a manual-review item and operator notification."
